(7674486, 1254029, 86447, '<td valign="top">I was expecting this from Anita.<br/> <br/>I could have almost drawn it.  <br/> <br/> <br/>Well done, Anita!</td>', 'I was expecting this from Anita. I could have almost drawn it.    Well done, Anita!', '2020-09-14 01:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674500, 1254200, 101668, '<td valign="top">Looked through quickly, this is best in show so far. Will vote later</td>', 'Looked through quickly, this is best in show so far. Will vote later', '2020-09-14 02:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674693, 1254191, 3306, '<td valign="top">The lighting is outstanding. My favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'The lighting is outstanding. My favorite of the challenge.', '2020-09-16 23:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674708, 1254184, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great imagination and setup. I love how you made little bags of flower. Top 3.</td>', 'Great imagination and setup. I love how you made little bags of flower. Top 3.', '2020-09-17 08:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674709, 1254029, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and descriptive. I can see this being used in a cook book or a magazine.</td>', 'Nicely composed and descriptive. I can see this being used in a cook book or a magazine.', '2020-09-17 08:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674710, 1254165, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is photographically interesting but seems a little over the top. What is the purpose of the flower on her lips? Did she kiss the candy? I like the effect of the flour movement with the blowing air.</td>', 'This is photographically interesting but seems a little over the top. What is the purpose of the flower on her lips? Did she kiss the candy? I like the effect of the flour movement with the blowing air.', '2020-09-17 08:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674711, 1254189, 3306, '<td valign="top">A fun composition. I think i would like to see the flour coming out of the container in the upper left corner. Also, everything is coming down more or less in a straight line. I think it would be more whimsical to make the objects more random as they fall. Just a suggestion.</td>', 'A fun composition. I think i would like to see the flour coming out of the container in the upper left corner. Also, everything is coming down more or less in a straight line. I think it would be more whimsical to make the objects more random as they fall. Just a suggestion.', '2020-09-17 08:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674712, 1253866, 3306, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and setup. I am a little confused by the lighting. The yellowish tone suggests sunrise or sunset. If it is sunrise then I think muffins or some breakfast bread would be more appropriate. If its sunset than it just feels like its too late to be making bread unless you are just demonstrating the ingredients. Just my opinion:)</td>', 'I really like the composition and setup. I am a little confused by the lighting. The yellowish tone suggests sunrise or sunset. If it is sunrise then I think muffins or some breakfast bread would be more appropriate. If its sunset than it just feels like its too late to be making bread unless you are just demonstrating the ingredients. Just my opinion:)', '2020-09-17 08:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7674713, 1254162, 114285, '<td valign="top">Good advert.</td>', 'Good advert.', '2020-09-17 09:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
